sequenceDiagram
Title: Re-derivation of Key with a DICE policy
participant c as Client
participant hwc as HwCrypto

Note over c,hwc: client uses stored generated_policy_1 to re-derive clear_aKey_ver_1

c->>+hwc: deriveDicePolicyBoundKey(derivationKey=DEVICE_BOUND_KEY, policy=generated_policy_1)
hwc-->>-c: (opaqueDerivationKey1, policyCurrent=True)

c->>+hwc: deriveKey(derivationKey=opaqueDerivationKey1, keyParameters=keySize, context="aKey")
hwc-->>-c: (clear_aKey_ver_1)
